@namespace SpaceSails.Client.Pages
@implements IHandleEvent
@*
    #251 · THE MASTHEAD BOX, ON ITS OWN FILE — the head of the flow column.

    `.map-topstack` is the one region of the column that is a BOX rather than a single gated surface:
    a div of its own with two children inside it, the desk tabs and the pilot banner with the #166 alert
    strip under it. #195 put the three of them in one in-flow column so a two- or three-row banner PUSHES
    the toolbar down instead of floating over it; #992 measured the column against the window; #1038 gave
    the box its peek-passthrough. All three of those facts are about THIS box, so they travel with it, and
    what is left where it stood is one tag.

    Moved out of FlowColumn.razor by PURE MOTION: the two gates came with the two invocations (a box with
    both gates shut renders an empty div, which is what it rendered before), and every member it reads is a
    [Parameter] with the SAME NAME. Nothing here writes.

    IHandleEvent repeats the page's own override (Map.Sim.cs). The .razor.css beside this file carries no
    rules; it exists to give the component Map.razor.css's scope (pinned in SpaceSails.Client.csproj), so
    the `.map-topstack` and `.map-peek` rules go on matching this div exactly as they matched it in the
    page — and the UI gate that measures the band off `.map-topstack`'s own laid-out box goes on finding it.
*@
@* ── MARKUP BEGINS · verbatim from Map.razor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── *@
    <div class="map-topstack peek-passthrough">

    @if (_surface is null)
    {
        <ShipTabsStrip _activeDesk="@_activeDesk" _peekMap="@_peekMap" DeskKeyLabel="@DeskKeyLabel"
                       DeskLabel="@DeskLabel" SwitchDeskFromClick="@SwitchDeskFromClick" TabBarOrder="@TabBarOrder"
                       TogglePeekMapFromClick="@TogglePeekMapFromClick" />
    }

    @if (_worldReady && !_deckMode)
    {
        <TopBannerStack _armedOrbitBodyId="@_armedOrbitBodyId" _bannerRowOffset="@_bannerRowOffset"
                        _dockReadyStatus="@_dockReadyStatus" _shipAlerts="@_shipAlerts"
                        AcknowledgeAlert="@AcknowledgeAlert" AuthorizePlunder="@AuthorizePlunder"
                        AutopilotStoodDown="@AutopilotStoodDown" BannerPageDown="@BannerPageDown"
                        BannerPageUp="@BannerPageUp" Board="@Board" DeclinePlunder="@DeclinePlunder"
                        FlightNowNext="@FlightNowNext" SwitchDeskFromClick="@SwitchDeskFromClick" />
    }
    </div>@* /.map-topstack — tabs · banner · alert strip; the Nav HUD (.map-hud) flows below it *@
@* ── MARKUP ENDS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── *@
